{"page":229,"verses":[{"verse_key":"11:63","surah":11,"ayah":63,"ar_uthmani":"قَالَ يَـٰقَوْمِ أَرَءَيْتُمْ إِن كُنتُ عَلَىٰ بَيِّنَةٍ مِّن رَّبِّى وَءَاتَىٰنِى مِنْهُ رَحْمَةً فَمَن يَنصُرُنِى مِنَ ٱللَّهِ إِنْ عَصَيْتُهُۥ ۖ فَمَا تَزِيدُونَنِى غَيْرَ تَخْسِيرٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"He said, ‘My people, just think: if I did have clear proof from my Lord, and if He had given me mercy of His own, who could protect me from God if I disobeyed Him? You would only make my loss greater.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"قَالَ","en_gloss":"He said","transliteration":"qāla","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":2,"ar":"يَـٰقَوْمِ","en_gloss":"O my people","transliteration":"yāqawmi","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَرَءَيْتُمْ","en_gloss":"Do you see","transliteration":"ara-aytum","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":4,"ar":"إِن","en_gloss":"if","transliteration":"in","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كُنتُ","en_gloss":"I am","transliteration":"kuntu","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":6,"ar":"عَلَىٰ","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿalā","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":7,"ar":"بَيِّنَةٍۢ","en_gloss":"a clear proof","transliteration":"bayyinatin","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":9,"ar":"رَّبِّى","en_gloss":"my Lord","transliteration":"rabbī","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَءَاتَىٰنِى","en_gloss":"and He has given me","transliteration":"waātānī","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مِنْهُ","en_gloss":"from Him","transliteration":"min'hu","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":12,"ar":"رَحْمَةًۭ","en_gloss":"a Mercy","transliteration":"raḥmatan","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":13,"ar":"فَمَن","en_gloss":"then who","transliteration":"faman","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":14,"ar":"يَنصُرُنِى","en_gloss":"(can) help me","transliteration":"yanṣurunī","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"against","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"11:63"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse